&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ownership of high-velocity execution, maintaining a sharp eye for detail in an environment where impact is paramount.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with experience navigating trade-offs across diverse disciplines like Marketing, Operations, and Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
